      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i might have messed up. i took my usual zoloft this morning and i just took a tramadol for my back pain like you said might be okay, but my heart is kind of racing and i feel really sweaty and jittery all of a sudden. is this normal or should i be worried?",
